        {
          "text": "\u0022Accepted changes are reconciled with the server, and rejected changes restore the previous status and explain why.\u0022 - [#235] specifies server reconciliation for the board and rollback on rejection for both the board and detail view. It does not say accepted detail-view changes are reconciled with the server; the wording applies that behavior to both views.",
